  "publisher": "Vernum Projecten B.V. (FerroBRIDGE)",
  "description": "Overrides ConceptMap/datatype-cwe-to-quantity of hl7.fhir.uv.v2mappings 1.0.0. The guide writes its targets as Quantity.code, Quantity.unit and Quantity.system, where every other data type map names the element relative to the type it fills (datatype-cwe-to-coding writes code, display and system), so the element table finds no element Quantity under the Quantity the row fills and the units of OBX-6 are lost. This supplement names them code, unit and system, the elements of the FHIR R4 Quantity data type; the sources and the conditions are the guide's. Recorded as an upstream defect on FerroBRIDGE #332.",
